                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <div>
                                <div class="text-terminal-green mb-2">→ Session Backup & Restore</div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-terminal-gray">
                                    Save your current workspace state and restore it later. Perfect for testing
                                    different configurations.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="text-terminal-green mb-2">→ Multi-Environment Management</div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-terminal-gray">
                                    Switch between different development setups instantly. Maintain separate
                                    configurations for different projects.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="text-terminal-green mb-2">→ Clean Reset</div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-terminal-gray">
                                    Reset your application to factory settings while keeping backups safe. Troubleshoot
                                    issues effectively.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="text-terminal-green mb-2">→ Account Management</div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-terminal-gray">
                                    Manage multiple user accounts and sessions. Switch between different authentication
                                    states seamlessly.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

