                            <p>→ Architecture: Modular & Cross-platform</p>
                            <p>→ Config Format: JSON</p>
                            <p>→ License: MIT</p>
                            <p>→ Repository: Open Source</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

